{"date":"2026-09-20","issue":12,"articles":[{"id":"2026-09-20-001","title":"地球内部看不见，科学家怎么知道地核是液态的？","status":"verified","core_facts":[{"fact":"P波比S波快，通常先到达地震台站。","status":"verified","sources":["USGS Seismographs","IRIS Seismic Wave Motions","BGS earthquake detection"]},{"fact":"P波可穿过固体和液体；S波不能在液体中传播。","status":"verified","sources":["USGS Interior of the Earth","USGS P/S wave paths","BGS earthquake detection"]},{"fact":"S波缺失及P波在外核的折射是液态外核的重要证据。","status":"verified","sources":["USGS Interior of the Earth","USGS P/S wave paths","IRIS Seismic Waves Viewer"]}],"unconfirmed":[],"images":[{"original_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Earthquake_wave_paths.png","download_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/Earthquake_wave_paths.png","http_validation":{"method":"web_direct_fetch","final_status":200,"content_verified":"image/png"},"license_validation":{"status":"verified","license":"Public Domain — U.S. Geological Survey work (PD-USGov-USGS)","credit":"U.S. Geological Survey / SEWilco"}},{"original_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SeismographLomaPreitaQuakeSeismologistSmile.jpg","download_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/SeismographLomaPreitaQuakeSeismologistSmile.jpg","http_validation":{"method":"web_direct_fetch","final_status":200,"content_verified":"image/jpeg"},"license_validation":{"status":"verified","license":"Public Domain — U.S. Geological Survey work (PD-USGov-USGS)","credit":"J.K. Nakata / U.S. Geological Survey"}}]},{"id":"2026-09-20-002","title":"指纹只是为了识别身份吗？它其实还在帮你稳稳抓住东西","status":"verified","core_facts":[{"fact":"指腹摩擦嵴与汗液共同影响抓握摩擦。","status":"verified","sources":["PNAS 2020","J R Soc Interface 2013","University of Birmingham"]},{"fact":"2009年干燥亚克力实验中，指纹脊线减少接触面积约三分之一，因此不能把指纹作用简单归结为增加摩擦。","status":"verified","sources":["Journal of Experimental Biology 2009","PubMed PMID 19525427"]},{"fact":"2020年研究提出汗孔阻塞与毛细蒸发共同调节指腹水分，使摩擦维持在有利范围。","status":"verified","sources":["PNAS 2020 DOI 10.1073/pnas.2001055117","PubMed PMID 33257543","University of Birmingham"]}],"unconfirmed":[],"images":[{"original_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tented_arch.jpg","download_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5b/Tented_arch.jpg","http_validation":{"method":"web_direct_fetch","final_status":200,"content_verified":"image/jpeg"},"license_validation":{"status":"verified","license":"Public Domain — U.S. Department of Commerce work (PD-USGov)","credit":"NIST"}},{"original_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fingerprt.jpg","download_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/Fingerprt.jpg","http_validation":{"method":"web_direct_fetch","final_status":200,"content_verified":"image/jpeg"},"license_validation":{"status":"verified","license":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0)","credit":"Katsamenis"}}]}]}